# Generated VBA OpenAPI Client

Experimental synchronous VBA client generated by `openapi-generator-vba` {{generatorVersion}}.

## Import order
1. `Runtime/*.cls`
2. `Models/*.cls`
3. `Apis/*.cls`
4. Add `JsonConverter.bas` from VBA-JSON if request/response JSON bodies are used.

## Usage
```vb
Dim client As New ApiClient
client.BaseUrl = "https://api.example.com"
client.BearerToken = "..."

Dim api As New DefaultApi
Set api.Client = client
```

### Current scope
GET/POST/etc., path/query parameters, one JSON body, bearer token, generated DTO shells. Object-valued JSON responses are exposed as the untyped `Object` returned by VBA-JSON (normally a `Dictionary`). JSON-to-typed-model hydration, multipart, OAuth flows, cookies, polymorphism, nullable-value semantics, binary streaming, and robust UTF-8 URL encoding are extension points.
